Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Here is a way to do it with base R -

x = c("avner", "moshe", "haim", "moti", "tal", "amit")
x
[1] "avner" "moshe" "haim"  "moti"  "tal"   "amit"
x[which(x == "moshe") : which(x == "tal")]
[1] "moshe" "haim"  "moti"  "tal"

